pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 1000, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>工程技术知识库（II）：施工组织与资源配置</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 85, 40, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: col1-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 370, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: col1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 125, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:calendar-days"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: col1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [122, 128, 280, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>进度计划编制规则</strong></p>
  - elementId: col1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 165, 330, 180]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: |
        <p>• 网络计划（关键线路法CPM）</p>
        <p>• 工序衔接逻辑与搭接关系</p>
        <p>• 节点工期计算方法</p>
        <p>• 季节性施工影响因素</p>
        <p>• 进度偏差分析与调整规则</p>
  - elementId: col2-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [450, 110, 370, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: col2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [470, 125, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:users-gear"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: col2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [512, 128, 280, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>资源配置模型</strong></p>
  - elementId: col2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 165, 330, 180]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: |
        <p>• 劳动力需求曲线（S曲线）</p>
        <p>• 设备进出场计划模板</p>
        <p>• 材料供应计划编制规则</p>
        <p>• 资金周转计划模型</p>
        <p>• 企业定额消耗量标准</p>
  - elementId: col3-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 110, 380, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: col3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [860, 125, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:helmet-safety"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: col3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [902, 128, 290, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>安全质量环保体系</strong></p>
  - elementId: col3-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 165, 340, 180]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: |
        <p>• 安全管理制度与应急预案</p>
        <p>• 质量保证体系与检验流程</p>
        <p>• 环保水保措施模板</p>
        <p>• 文明施工标准化要求</p>
        <p>• 职业健康管理规范</p>
  - elementId: bottom-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 385, 1160, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: bottom-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [90, 405, 36, 36]
    iconName: "fas:wrench"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: bottom-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 408, 500, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>临时设施布置规则库</strong></p>
  - elementId: bottom-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 455, 1100, 145]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "#FFFFFFCC"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.8
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent;"><strong>项目驻地</strong></span>  选址原则（距工地距离/交通便利性/场地面积≥3000㎡）</p>
        <p><span style="color:$accent;"><strong>拌合站</strong></span>  产能计算→设备选型（120型/180型）→环保设施配置</p>
        <p><span style="color:$accent;"><strong>梁场</strong></span>  台座数量=日产量×养护周期 / 龙门吊跨度≥梁长+2m</p>
        <p><span style="color:$accent;"><strong>施工便道</strong></span>  宽度≥4.5m / 纵坡≤10% / 与地方道路衔接方案</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 660, 1160, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1190, 680, 50, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      align: [right, middle]
      text: |
        <p>13</p>